Single-target Holy/NE piercing white magic attack at True Cap Break Level 1, Instant ATB 1 & Instant Cast 1 to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Holy Abilities;
[Dualcast Holy 3, Instant Holy 3 & Weakness Damage +30% for 3 turns to user] or [50% Stoneskin, Dualcast Holy 3 & Instant Holy 3 to party] if user has at less than 100/50% HP

